<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for Austria.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for Austria.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Austria:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 1.0	  1.6</p>
<p> Investment			 4.6	  4.1</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     2.0	  1.9</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     4.1	  4.3</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  4.3	  3.0</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		   71.7	 72.2</p>
</text>
